UID: GSSC-PIR-PUBLIC-FRONTEND
TITLE: Public Frontend

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-1
TITLE: Public Frontend Application
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website SHALL have a publicly accessible frontend application on its public-facing primary domain.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-9
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-1
  ROLE: Satisfies

